{"title":"Harbor Seal","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 3 Wildlife that attacks with stab (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"seal-blubber\" title=\"Seal Blubber - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/a28f15f016dc1a58b491.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Seal Blubber</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wildlife: <a href=\"#/monster/seagull\">Seagull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rabbit\">Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chicken\">Chicken</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frog\">Frog</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/arctic-hare\">Arctic Hare</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/crab\">Crab</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deer\">Deer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sheep\">Sheep</a> <span class=\"muted\">(